{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】 帶您直擊可體驗遊戲直播的「佳能」展位！現場還舉辦了有機會贏得豪華獎品的扭蛋活動！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c2db11533032486bcf1f3d1bcd5a92416928f011d5c6f939fe7cf5f9e28cd7d1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb36d58ece79c2ef876dc0da199aa70db.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日(四)～21日(一・假)為期5天舉辦的遊戲盛會「 東京電玩展2026 」 這次想為大家報導提供直播應用程式「 Live Switcher Mobile 」的「 佳能 」展位！</p><h3>「佳能」展位報導！親身體驗只需智慧型手機即可自訂遊戲直播的應用程式</h3><p>Live Switcher Mobile</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/93407ce0588405440fcf24db07293c111765751ca686544b52b6ecdcfde068a3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F49426a592ba13dd8ebdfb7c15a730cc4.jpg\"/><p>首先最引人注目的是這款僅需透過智慧型手機即可變更直播畫面佈局的直播應用程式「 Live Switcher Mobile 」</p><p>搭載多種功能</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7633b114b8e44bf2629790ddadb8d2b28e2fe539687e9f3d0d768a5f2dc02f3a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe35a18ed070cdc416a9608e6acb4b629.jpg\"/><p>來打造專屬於你的直播畫面吧</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1dfc919297a03c584d5281cfb5d8f70016fa600d54a1c9aa82e29ffaada0cd05/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F46432deae5f575c66fe45b18101e92e9.jpg\"/><p>據說只要有這款應用程式，即使是直播新手也能打造出讓觀眾輕鬆觀看的版面配置。 看來可以直觀地將遊戲畫面、畫中畫、字幕和評論等元素組合在一起。</p><p>遊戲直播的示意圖</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7986486c31140d6338b5834d903fa3a98dbcc70217196a8892a9e699a99dac29/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6c6b4fe81bf73bdd6405f1ed2602ae0a.jpg\"/><p>現場還設有模擬實際遊戲直播情境的區域。</p><p>可以實際動手試試看</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a397805571dc6f609b88751fcfbb94f756707b331b5abb708aafc8630cc86aed/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fac6c7574a231cb65e0d8335740956fbf.jpg\"/><p>看來似乎可以調整直播畫面，那就實際試試看吧。</p><p>甚至還能加上可愛的字幕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/958ef5cf3d57fc92b117e45a38e1316a4a7cfbd09c8241c46bdbda7bbea72b9f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5b4cf0b6eac92aa9aece5adee8c6eb12.jpg\"/><p>不僅能輕鬆移動轉場的位置，還能立即添加字幕。 這是一款很適合直播新手的應用程式呢。</p><p>其他遊戲直播的畫面</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1f945618538ad3e1171389d6c914bc5f24bcc6bac8fe1c02b5a9efe13bc21c73/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F725f5a0ae3172234222dd3aa178e878b.jpg\"/><p>字幕內容也很豐富</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2365adbddb5ad45af71468093a1cbb502ad269bd67f4d3ec39fcd9dc768d89a6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Febbb163c53bad6d3f142b10f7a272c24.jpg\"/><p>巨大手機</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/85a0281d6049aa6272c5187126e4aab9ba127ce5131a2fdc3eea419a22bb51c0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F571482b3687af2dab62232b6c0e040da.jpg\"/><p>在巨大手機前進行遊戲直播</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/61ca694448c331914b907ee4bc02071cb90f9d0119c352d8400e3694f6ef825d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8fc6d60e704abce56f4f750fc7590ea3.jpg\"/><p>展場中還展示了各式各樣的直播畫面示意圖，讓人了解到其高度的可自訂性也是這項產品的魅力所在。</p><p>對遊戲直播有興趣嗎？</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c028013a5d7b901f289d1c8199d5cda2ba21c3e4bc0cfe63d8f3e5b9fab104f0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2e62f2a6ce18f4f43ed3655fc119e173.jpg\"/><p>在直播體驗區旁邊，發現了一個只要回答問題就能轉動的扭蛋。</p><p>獎品一覧</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2b9ec8b5ee61402f5a1fc6c87a68082835d9efde8f7399531ebffd4d478e8e45/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff299437aa92fe3e7b32523df58c2ce49.jpg\"/><p>可獲得的獎品有・・・</p><p>Live Switcher Mobile 付費方案 3 個月試用券: 500人</p><p>Anker USB-C集線器: 10人</p><p>佳能相機迷你模型: 200人</p><p>花王Bub泡澡劑: 3000人</p><p>・・・4種。 小編也想實際試著轉轉看。 不知道會抽到什麼很期待。</p><p>拿到代幣了</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/16f2e99083d8937881026e0453620d32de03bdb82b8e8ba07be8099f07934a3b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F627e04a17fe700c9b8342b94f3252513.jpg\"/><p>回答問題後，便獲得了代幣。</p><p>轉一轉</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7077bda6d8453cf29d97afc06aee16f410708b52493e1e3186af9d7f84259faf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F24ed548c36da2ab18fece8812b29e5d2.jpg\"/><p>將代幣放入插槽然後轉一轉・・・</p><p>扭蛋出來了！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/84b12b232478e1a66dbe2c1b26575b60181fbcf4d37123628fa58436eff691d7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F41424d2b262a43c562d708d37b990cbf.jpg\"/><p>得到了黃色的扭蛋！ 打開來看看！</p><p>得到了Bub泡澡劑！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6692d480e9bec69a0e4757e40baf98a97b18579cc5332585a2f04aea14d11719/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7272f6cc4407277e8df67429b7e6480c.jpg\"/><p>得到了Bub泡澡劑！ 看來東京電玩展的疲勞應該能徹底消除囉！</p><p>以上是「佳能」展位的現場報導！</p><p>🔸「Lenovo」參展TGS2026！Lenovo「鬼武者 Way of the Sword」特別體驗區以及「Lenovo Legion」系列展示等 🔸【TGS2026】「ZETA DIVISION」攤位報導！也發表了與「T1 Esports Academy」的業務合作 🔸【TGS2026】在現代復活的「NEOGEO AES+」實機公開！在「PLAION REPLAI」攤位也可試玩 🔸【TGS2026】SPYGEA攤位報導！2.4m的巨大「SPYGEA」以及能感受魅力的活動年表展示等 🔸Pixio開始接受「宙星ぱる」「蒼真なひろ」聯名玻璃滑鼠墊的預購！TGS2026可展示實物並在現場預購</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T10:38:30.151199+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1155,"images":17,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}